name: MGLRU (Multi-Gen LRU)
source: Linux 5.18 / 6.1
description: Multi-generational LRU page reclaim. Improves memory pressure handling, reduces CPU usage for page scanning, better cold/hot page detection. Google adopted in Android 6.1 kernels.
config: CONFIG_LRU_GEN=y, CONFIG_LRU_GEN_ENABLED=y
status: experimental
baseline: 4.19
